# GitHub Actions

- When working with GitHub Actions, always look for and prefer existing GitHub Actions (Marketplace, official, or repo-owned reusable actions) to minimize logic inside workflow files.
- Keep workflow YAML focused on orchestration (triggers, inputs, job order); push implementation into reusable actions rather than inline `run:` steps.
- Before adding new inline steps, check whether an action already exists.
- For AWS authentication in workflows, use **OIDC federation** per `22-github-actions-aws-oidc.mdc`.
